# Icons

- **Never use `Sparkles`** (or `Sparkle`, `WandSparkles`, or any other sparkle or "magic" icon) from `lucide-react` or anywhere else. Don't use ✨ emoji in UI copy either.
- AI actions don't need a "magic" icon. Use an icon that says what the action does, or no icon at all.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
import { Sparkles } from "lucide-react";
<Sparkles /> Instruct Choreo…

// ✅ GOOD: describes the action
import { MessageSquareText } from "lucide-react";
<MessageSquareText /> Instruct Choreo…

// ✅ GOOD: text only
<button>Describe story</button>
```
